# What must never reach the build context, and why.
#
# The first block is the point of this file: the clean tables carry customer names,
# street addresses and 3,340 client IPs. Anything here is out of every layer, every
# registry push and every `docker save` tarball. A snapshot is mounted at runtime
# instead. `tests/test_deploy.py` fails if these lines go.
data/
dataset/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
credentials.json

# Generated evidence. Reports describe a run, not the application, and a stale one in
# an image is worse than none.
reports/

# Not needed to serve a dashboard, and each one is layer weight or noise.
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.claude/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
project_roadmap.md
pytest.ini
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
